  "description": "Jellyfin HTTP traffic and .NET runtime health. Metrics verified against Jellyfin v12.4 (EnableMetrics: Startup.cs UseHttpMetrics/MapMetrics, prometheus-net.AspNetCore 8.2.1: http_requests_received_total, http_request_duration_seconds, http_requests_in_progress) and prometheus-net 8.2.1 DotNetStats (process_*, dotnet_total_memory_bytes, dotnet_collection_count_total); Jellyfin publishes no dashboard and no media-level metrics (playback statistics are in Streamystats).",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
